flowchart TB
    raw[Raw video] --> stt[ElevenLabs STT]
    stt -->|Transcript| director[Director]
    prompt[User prompt / intent enhancement] --> director
    skills[Video editing skills / style constraints] --> director
    director --> plan[Deterministic tool call plan]
    plan --> registry[Tool registry / keyword matching]
    registry -->|Resolved tool calls| executor[Tool executor]
    registry -. Asset query .-> matcher[Fuzzy asset lookup]
    library[Manifest-backed asset library / overlays / voiceovers] -. Candidates .-> matcher
    matcher -. Matched assets .-> executor
    tools[30–60 tools: FX, B-roll, memes, audio, screenshots,
animation, subtitles, icons / GIFs, crop, cut, denoise,
undo, redo, render] --> executor
    executor -->|Each output| judge[LLM as a judge]
    judge -->|Fail / undo tool call| executor
    judge -->|Pass| final[Approved edit / render and deliver]
    executor -. Context .-> yoga[(YogaDB / recall context)]
    executor -. Timing and speed logs .-> tiger[(TigerDB / logging)]
    %% Concept transcribed from the supplied handwritten sketch.
    %% Asset-query and bottom constraint wording are interpreted.
    %% Database names are preserved as written, without product verification.
